---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Rajan Gupta" description="Freelance WordPress &amp; WooCommerce developer in New Delhi. 9+ years, 150+ projects. Custom themes, fast stores and white-label agency work.">
	<div class="stack gap-20">
		<main class="wrapper about">
			<Hero
				title="About"
				tagline="Thanks for stopping by. Read below to learn more about myself and my background."
			>
				<center><img align="center"
					width="400"
					height="400"
					src="/assets/at-work.png"
					alt="Rajan Gupta | Wordpress Developer"
				/></center>
			</Hero>

			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Background</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>
						Rajan Gupta is a freelance WordPress and WooCommerce developer based in New Delhi, India, working remotely with agencies and businesses worldwide, including clients in the UK, US, UAE and Ireland.
					</p>
					<p>
						WordPress has been my full-time work since 2016 (9+ years), with 150+ projects delivered. I build custom themes and WooCommerce stores without page builders, using Sage, ACF Pro, Tailwind CSS and Vite. You work directly with the person writing the code: no account managers and no junior handoffs. Every project includes 30 days of free support, and I aim for 90+ mobile PageSpeed where technically achievable.
					</p>
					<p>Website: <a href="https://rajangupta.com/">rajangupta.com</a> · Email: <a href="mailto:hello@rajangupta.com">hello@rajangupta.com</a></p>
					<h4>Services</h4>
					<ul>
						<li>Custom WooCommerce store development</li>
						<li>Custom WordPress themes, including Figma to WordPress</li>
						<li>Speed and Core Web Vitals optimisation</li>
						<li>Custom plugins and REST API integrations</li>
						<li>White-label development for agencies, under NDA</li>
						<li>Maintenance, migrations, security and malware removal</li>
					</ul>
					<h4>Selected work</h4>
					<ul>
						<li><a href="https://rajangupta.com/case-studies/kazen-custom-woocommerce-skincare-store-sage-11/">KAZEN</a>: custom WooCommerce store on Sage 11 for a professional skincare brand</li>
						<li><a href="https://rajangupta.com/case-studies/weavira-custom-woocommerce-handloom-saree-store/">Weavira</a>: WooCommerce store for a handloom saree brand from Odisha</li>
						<li><a href="https://rajangupta.com/case-studies/yummy-cake-woocommerce-bakery-redesign/">Yummy Cake</a>: WooCommerce bakery redesign in Delhi NCR</li>
						<li><a href="https://rajangupta.com/case-studies/custom-wordpress-build-for-suncos-natural-wholesale-moq-bulk-enquiries/">Suncos Natural</a>: wholesale WordPress site with minimum order quantities and bulk enquiries</li>
					</ul>
					&nbsp;
					<h4>Top Achievements:</h4>
					<ol>
						<li><b>WordPress Theme Customization and Development:</b><br />
							Rajan specializes in WordPress theme customization and development. He has successfully delivered projects involving WordPress theme customization, bug fixing, maintenance, PSD to WordPress conversion, HTML to WordPress theme conversion, and WordPress child theme development. His ability to convert comprehensive layouts and wireframes into working HTML pages showcases his expertise in translating design concepts into functional websites.

						</li>
						<li><b>WooCommerce Development and E-commerce Expertise:</b><br />With his proficiency in WooCommerce, Rajan has contributed to the development of e-commerce websites. He has designed and developed responsive e-commerce websites, implemented new features and functionality, and ensured high performance and availability of the CMS. His skills in integrating WooCommerce plugins and managing the back-end of e-commerce websites demonstrate his ability to create effective online shopping experiences.</li>
						<li><b>ADA Compliance and Accessibility Expertise:</b><br />Rajan has extensive experience in performing audits and ensuring compliance with accessibility standards, including WCAG (Conformance Levels: A, AA, AAA) and ADA - Section 508 of the Rehabilitation Act. He has a profound understanding of accessibility requirements and has implemented accessibility solutions in various projects, making websites more inclusive and user-friendly.</li>
					</ol>
					<p>Overall, Rajan Gupta has a strong background in WordPress development, with a focus on theme customization, accessibility, and WooCommerce development. His expertise in building user-friendly and accessible websites, along with his technical skills and project management abilities, makes him a valuable asset in the field of WordPress development.</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Education</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p>MCA (IT), Indira Gandhi National Open University (IGNOU)</p>
					<p>Bachelor of Science Information Technology</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Skills</h2>
				<div class="content">
					<p> - Modern WordPress Theme Development using as like Sage, Bedrock, laravel Template, WP Twig</p>
					<p> - Good understanding of front-end technologies, including HTML5, BOOTSTRAP,TAILWINDCSS, RESPONSIVE, Foundation, JavaScript, jQuery, Vue, SASS, Composer,NPM, Vue and Reactjs etc.</p>
					<p> - Minifying HTML, CSS, JS e.t.c </p>
					<p> - Familiar with accessibility standards (ADA Compliance)</p>
					<p> - Experience designing and developing responsive design websites</p>
					<p> - Comfortable working with debugging tools like Firebug, Chrome Inspector, etc.</p>
					<p> - Ability to convert comprehensive layouts and wireframes into working HTML pages</p>
					<p> - Knowledge of how to interact with RESTful APIs and formats (JSON, XML)</p>
					<p> - Proficient understanding of code versioning tools Git</p>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<ContactCTA />
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3.5rem;
	}

	img {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
	}

	section {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--gray-200);
	}

	.section-title {
		grid-column-start: 1;
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		color: var(--gray-0);
	}

	.content {
		grid-column: 2 / 4;
	}

	.content :global(a) {
		text-decoration: 1px solid underline transparent;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
		transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
	}

	.content :global(a:hover),
	.content :global(a:focus) {
		text-decoration-color: currentColor;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.about {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 60% 1fr;
		}

		.about > :global(:first-child) {
			grid-column-start: 2;
		}

		section {
			display: contents;
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}
	}
</style>
